707	/**
708	 * Render the workspace detail view.
709	 *
710	 * Fetches workspace metadata, project (for the repositories list), polling
711	 * configuration, and initial Git status in parallel. Then starts a polling
712	 * interval that updates badges in-place using the server-configured interval
713	 * (falls back to {@link DEFAULT_POLL_INTERVAL_MS} if the config fetch fails).
714	 *
